    },
    "created_at": "2020-10-30T04:01:20Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-10-30T04:01:20Z",
    "body": "Another placeholder technique that seems to be gaining traction is using a blurhash: https://github.com/woltapp/blurhash\r\n\r\nWe could add a single attribute to `<img>` e.g. `<img blurhash=\"{hash}\" src=...>`, no need to rely on external resources, which is a quality what you want in a placeholder...\r\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
