    "created_at": "2022-07-26T17:21:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-07-26T17:21:46Z",
    "body": "The appearance of images with no `src` also needs to be controllable. Currently UAs draw an outline which is not overridable in CSS (https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=171326); ideally that rendering would be described in the UA stylesheet, allow authors to customize it.\r\n\r\nSo this proposal needs to cover both selector hooks allowing authors to style images in their various states, and the default UA style rules.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
