    "created_at": "2026-11-07T01:34:19Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-07T01:34:19Z",
    "body": "Thanks for linking the proposal! The [Image Preview Explainer](https://github.com/MicrosoftEdge/MSEdgeExplainers/blob/main/ImagePreview/explainer.md) covers image, compact-data, and color previews, including different previews for `<picture>` sources. It also sketches separate CSS controls for styling loading stages and transitions. Loading previews ahead of lazy-loaded images remains an open question. Feedback is welcome!",
